     \[
     2 \text{ days} \times 10 \text{ miles/day} = 20 \text{ miles}
     \]

3. **Total distance in a week:**
   - Add the distances from weekdays and weekends:
     \[
     100 \text{ miles} + 20 \text{ miles}
     \boxed{120}
