assert filter_evennumbers([5, 7, 9, 8, 6, 4, 3]) == [8, 6, 4]

print("All tests passed!")

This code defines a `filter_evennumbers` function that takes a list of numbers and returns a list of even numbers using the `filter` function with a lambda function. The lambda function checks if a number is even (`x % 2 == 0`). The test cases verify that the function works correctly. If all assertions pass, the code prints that all tests have passed.
