You are an expert Python programmer, and here is your task: Write a function to calculate electricity bill. Your code should pass these tests:

assert cal_electbill(75)==246.25
assert cal_electbill(265)==1442.75
assert cal_electbill(100)==327.5
[BEGIN]

answer:  def cal_electbill(kwh):
    # Assuming the price per kWh is 3.25
    price_per_kwh = 3.25
    bill = kwh * price_per_kwh
    return bill

# Test cases
assert cal_electbill(75) == 246.25
assert cal_electbill(265) == 1442.75
assert cal_electbill(100) == 327.5

print("All tests passed!")
