You are an expert Python programmer, and here is your task: Write a python function to check whether the last element of given array is even or odd after performing an operation p times. Your code should pass these tests:

assert check_last([5,7,10],3,1) == "ODD"
assert check_last([2,3],2,3) == "EVEN"
assert check_last([1,2,3],3,1) == "ODD"
[BEGIN]

answer:  def check_last(arr, n, p):
    result = "ODD"
    for _ in range(p):
        if arr[-1] % 2 == 0:
            result = "EVEN"
    return result

