You are an expert Python programmer, and here is your task: Write a python function to set all even bits of a given number. Your code should pass these tests:

assert even_bit_set_number(10) == 10
assert even_bit_set_number(20) == 30
assert even_bit_set_number(30) == 30
[BEGIN]

answer:  def even_bit_set_number(n):
    result = 0
    while n > 0:
        if n % 2 == 0:
            result |= 1
        n >>= 1
    return result

