assert count_first_elements((2, 9, (5, 7), 11) ) == 2
assert count_first_elements((11, 15, 5, 8, (2, 3), 8) ) == 4
[BEGIN]

answer:  def count_first_elements(tup, record):
    count = 0
    for element in tup:
        if element < record:
            count += 1
    return count

